    "done_when": "Done when: for each of the operators flux_surface_averaged , volume_averaged , line_averaged , line_integrated and time_derivative , two names that apply it to different quantities, written by the pipeline on a disposable graph, carry the same operator sentence and the same equation form, differing only in the substituted symbol and quantity words; for a species family of at least five members written by the pipeline on a disposable graph, the description is one wording after the species is substituted, and the population statement is identical across members; the wording census committed in docs/evidence/fragments/sn-definitions-by-construction/ , run over those written names, counts one form per operator and one wording per family, and counts more than one on a family planted with a divergent member; a definition whose shared part the model altered or contradicted is never stored as the model wrote it: what is stored carries the settled wording, or nothing is stored. This is shown by a test that feeds such a model answer through the writer's own entry point and reads back what was stored, so it holds on the path the pipeline takes and not only when a check is called directly; at least ten names written this way are put through the pipeline's documentation review beside a control: the published definition of the same name, held in a second seeded copy so that writing does not replace it, and reviewed in the same run with the same context and by the same route; a name the review returns no judgment on in one arm or in both is left out of the comparison, the number left out is recorded for each arm, at least ten names are decided in both arms, and over those the documentation review accepts the written definitions at least as often as the control, and the conformance check this section adds does not stand in for that review, and every written name the review sends back is listed with the review's reason, any reason that names a rendered shared sentence being repaired or listed as a defect of this change; the cost of writing one family member is recorded beside the present per-name documentation cost; the gate runs on a compute partition and its log is committed under the evidence directory.",
